	(text "⚠ XNANO MODIFICATION REQUIRED:\n  Cut R100 (0Ω strap inside XNANO) to isolate VTG from USB-5V.\n  After cut, J1.1 (VTG) is fed by VIN_5V from external bench supply (5V/3A, wired to VIN_5V label).\n  mEDBG stays on USB-5V (separate domain) — debug works during firmware-ADC low-V cutoff test (R11)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.226 170.942 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "09b3858d-3188-45ad-bf4a-96f124013e9f")
	)
	(text "031-BEACON-CAMERA Phase 1a EVAL — LM3410X boost LED driver + 5× L1IZ-0850 IR string + ATtiny416-XNANO drive"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "11d0bad7-5594-47ab-ba4c-3b0a5f7907ab")
	)
	(text "50ma expected drive"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 81.788 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "93d9fb69-e2a0-4eae-baa1-4f01243caacf")
	)
	(text "XNANO J200 pin map (ATtiny416-XNANO edge connector)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  pin  1 → VTG       (cut-strap modified, fed from VIN_5V)\n  pin  2 → PA0/UPDI  (mEDBG programming — not user-wired)\n  pin  3 → PA1       (mEDBG UART TX)         — NC on eval\n  pin  4 → PA2       (mEDBG UART RX)         — NC on eval\n  pin  5 → PA3       *** DIM control to U1 ***\n  pin  6 → PA4   ⚠ ATtiny412 lacks PA4 — DO NOT USE\n  pin  7 → PA5   ⚠ ATtiny412 lacks PA5 — DO NOT USE\n  pin  8 → PA6       (available; CSEL0 in target?)\n  pin  9 → PA7       (available; CSEL1 in target?)\n  pin 10 → PB5 ⚠ pins 10-19 are ATtiny416-only — DO NOT USE\n  pin 11 → PB4\n  pin 12 → PB3\n  pin 13 → PB2\n  pin 14 → PB1\n  pin 15 → PB0\n  pin 16 → PC0\n  pin 17 → PC1\n  pin 18 → PC2\n  pin 19 → PC3\n  pin 20 → GND\n\nFIRMWARE PORTABILITY: only PA0/1/2/3/6/7 are common to ATtiny412 and\nATtiny416 — restricting to these pins lets the SAME firmware build\ntarget both chips (toolchain: PlatformIO + megaTinyCore)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 43.18 133.604 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dc72333d-d8c5-4c62-8759-24ca62bef68f")
	)
